<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Output at Buffels unaffected by violence.</title>
<headline>Output at Buffels unaffected by violence.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Output at Buffelsfontein Gold Mining Company Ltd had not been affected by violence at mines in the area southwest of Johannesburg, mine managers Randgold &amp; Exploration Co Ltd said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Normal working operations at Buffelsfontein have not been affected by the fighting in the area over the past three days,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Ethnic clashes between members of the Sotho and Xhosa tribes has killed 21 people and injured 38 over the last three days.</p>
<p>The spokesman said that the situation in the area appeared to be calm and that the fighting had been brought under control.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
